      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "יעמדו נא",
      "rationale": "Heburu fɔcogo 'ka wyɔrɔ, aw ni wolo' ye kɔkɔrɔda ye; o ye taamasiyɛn ye min bɛ jira ko kuma ma kɛ — nka a kɔrɔ tiɲɛ ye fɔli ye min bɛ lafiya."
